 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2021-11-18",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Sales for the first 4 months of the new trading year are ahead of the comparative for last year.",
   "file": "20211118_JHD_Chairman's-Statement-to-the-Annual-General-Meeting.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-01",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Given the increased costs of materials, freight and energy that have prevailed and the inevitable time lag in reflecting these costs in prices it is to be expected that profit has been affected in the first six months results to a marginal extent.",
   "file": "20220201_JHD_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-31",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "As a manufacturer we are experiencing levels of inflation not seen in a generation. The passing on of costs is a necessary consequence and whilst we do not know yet we are mindful that demand may be affected.",
   "file": "20220331_JHD_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-08-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Inevitably delays in increasing prices have had an effect on margins however the actions we have taken have helped to contain this impact.",
   "file": "20220801_JHD_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-03",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "In the light of current demand, with the accumulated industry experience at our disposal, I, and the Board, remain confident of progress over the medium term, notwithstanding the short term challenges I have highlighted in my statement.",
   "file": "20221003_JHD_Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-12-01",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Turning to the current trading, on the positive side, our confidence in the resilience of commercial flooring continues and in most markets sales are ahead of this stage last year.",
   "file": "20221201_JHD_Chairman's-Statement-to-the-Annual-General-Meeting.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-02",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "However, the Board's expectations for the full year remain positive and unchanged.",
   "file": "20230202_JHD_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-31",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "However, the effects of transportation costs, energy price increases and raw materials costs have meant that profit is lower than last year. The profit before tax is £23.2 million (2021: £25.4 million), a drop of 8.6%.",
   "file": "20230331_JHD_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-08-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company's market expectations for the full year remain unchanged.",
   "file": "20230801_JHD_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-02",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With greater availability of global shipping, a strong balance sheet and a proven business model, we are confident in the prospects of the year ahead and progress across the Group.",
   "file": "20231002_JHD_Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-12-01",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "We are confident of achieving full year market expectations of improved bottom line results and exceeding the half year comparatives, as well as extending our track record of increased dividends.",
   "file": "20231201_JHD_AGM-Statement.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-31",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company will, despite softening of sales demand in some European markets, report profits in the region of 15-20% ahead of the prior year comparative and with a robust cash balance.",
   "file": "20240131_JHD_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-03-27",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
